        "message": "feat(PR-S5): 1000-bot economy run and exploit scan\n\n720 compressed hourly epochs (not a 30 Hz replay). Exact bigint accounting:\nminted 396540940 - burned 322893108 = 73647832, zero negative balances,\ndeterministic checksum 080bf7af.\n\nINFLATION TARGET FAILS: 726478 bps = 7264.78% vs <=5%. Per GDD-ECONOMY §8.4\nthe faucet rate is flagged TUNABLE, not silently retuned to make a gate pass.\nGini 0.080768 is recorded, never asserted. A value-printing cycle is detected\nand named; 10 faucet-key replays are refused.\n\nGDD-ECONOMY 0.3 (I9), corrupted §18 table repaired. The blueprint acc\n'pnpm sim prs5 --assert' could never run; repaired to the vitest command\n(fifteenth broken form). qa-engineer declared co-owner up front.\n\nNot ECON-001-complete: no real market, players, faction dynamics or network.\nNo art, no GPU/TPU (ND-012).\n\nAcceptance: test 5/5, full 166/166, verify 17/17, tracer green.\n\nAgent: economy-designer\nTask: PR-S5",
